{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ALSA-2026:70498","published":"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-10-05T13:26:54.839953372Z","related":["CVE-2025-39964","CVE-2026-45894","CVE-2026-45959","CVE-2026-53062","CVE-2026-63823","CVE-2026-64534","CVE-2026-68155","CVE-2026-68159","CVE-2026-68188","CVE-2026-68293","CVE-2026-68391","CVE-2026-74518"],"summary":"Important: kernel security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"The kernel packages contain the Linux kernel, the core of any Linux operating system.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * kernel: crypto: af_alg - Disallow concurrent writes in af_alg_sendmsg (CVE-2025-39964)\n  * kernel: iommu/vt-d: Clear Present bit before tearing down PASID entry (CVE-2026-45894)\n  * kernel: crypto: ccp - Fix a crash due to incorrect cleanup usage of kfree (CVE-2026-45959)\n  * kernel: dm cache policy smq: fix missing locks in invalidating cache blocks (CVE-2026-53062)\n  * kernel: keys: Pin request_key_auth payload in instantiate paths (CVE-2026-63823)\n  * kernel: nvmet-tcp: check INIT_FAILED before nvmet_req_uninit in digest error path (CVE-2026-64534)\n  * kernel: net/mlx5: Fix MCIA register buffer overflow on 32 dword reads (CVE-2026-68293)\n  * kernel: Linux kernel: libceph stack out-of-bounds write via crafted OSDMap (CVE-2026-68159)\n  * kernel: Linux kernel Bluetooth RFCOMM: Denial of Service via use-after-free in set_termios (CVE-2026-68188)\n  * kernel: Linux kernel (libceph): Denial of Service due to malformed monitor maps (CVE-2026-68155)\n  * kernel: Bluetooth: mgmt: hold reference for hci_conn in mgmt_pending_cmds (CVE-2026-68391)\n  * kernel: mm/hugetlb: fix list corruption in allocate_file_region_entries() (CVE-2026-74518)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Update kernel to use new certificate paths [almalinux-10.2.z] (JIRA:AlmaLinux-169478)\n  * RHIVOS - [backport] S32G Driver Enablement - PWM (JIRA:AlmaLinux-255517)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kernel-64k-debug-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-64k-debug-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"6.12.0-211.58.1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:70498.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-64k-debug-devel-matched","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-64k-debug-devel-matched"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"6.12.0-211.58.1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:70498.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-64k-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-64k-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"6.12.0-211.58.1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:70498.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-64k-devel-matched","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-64k-devel-matched"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"6.12.0-211.58.1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:70498.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-cross-headers","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-cross-headers"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"6.12.0-211.58.1.el10_2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:70498.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-debug","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-debug"},"ranges":[{"type